      "review_description": "Went with SolarSA as they were the most experienced Company of the quotes I got.Unfortunately the original system design by the salesman was not possible due to insufficient pace on North facing roof and after being given an installation date was told on the morning of that day that they still had to work out how to do it. This resulted in waiting another month for installation (with a couple of rainy day appointments canceled). Installation was redesigned facing East but an extra Solar panel was put in at 1/2 price resulting in a 1.92 kW system.So main problem was waiting well over 2 months for installation.Installation was well done and after the first few days I am very happy with the performance of the system.",
